@startuml i2cSlaveDriverStateMachine
state Uninitialized
state Initialized
state AddressMatched
state ReceivingData
state TransmittingData

[*] --> Uninitialized

Uninitialized --> Initialized : Init(config)
Initialized --> Uninitialized : DeInit()

Initialized --> Initialized : SetAddress()
Initialized --> Initialized : SetRxBuffer()
Initialized --> Initialized : SetTxBuffer()
Initialized --> Initialized : IsAddressed()
Initialized --> Initialized : RegisterCallback()

Initialized --> AddressMatched : Master addresses this slave

AddressMatched --> ReceivingData : Master sends data
AddressMatched --> TransmittingData : Master requests data

ReceivingData --> Initialized : Reception complete
TransmittingData --> Initialized : Transmission complete

note right of AddressMatched
  Address match detected
  Callback invoked
end note
@enduml
